atical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_5", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_6", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_7", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}, {"type": "secondary_8", "content": "Communicates effectively in English about the communicative topics for this level through the use of appropriate basic vocabulary and grammatical structures, and with intelligible pronunciation."}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Identifying and Managing Misunderstandings"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you don't understand what someone says, be polite when you ask them to repeat. You can use the Simple Present tense. <br/> <br/><span class=\"italic\"> Example: Can you help me?</span><br><br> When you correct a misunderstanding, stress the words you need the person to hear."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":2,\"columns\":2,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Identifying a Misunderstanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Managing a Misunderstanding\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Sorry Miss,</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">I'm sorry, but ...</span> <BR><span class=\\\"italic\\\">This ticket is for ___ <span class=\\\"strong\\\">not</span> ___.</span> \\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"italic\\\">Are you sure?</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can you check again, please!</span> <br><span class=\\\"italic\\\">Can someone help me?</span> \\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" instruction_table_background intro_table_border\"}"}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>: I'm sorry, but your name is not on the passenger list.          <bR>  <span class=\"strong\">Traveler</span>: Can you check again, please!"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"type": "heading", "content": "Traveling by Air"}, {"type": "describer", "content": "When you travel by airplane there are many words to listen for.  The ticket agent takes your luggage at the check-in counter. Heavy bags often have an overweight charge.  <br><br> A carry-on is 23 cm by 40 cm by 55 cm. Larger carry-ons have to be weighed and checked.<br><Br>First class customers can have more luggage. They wait in a special lounge with free tea, coffee and snacks."}, {"type": "example", "content": "<span class=\"strong\"> Ticket Agent</span>: Please put your luggage on the scale. <BR><span class=\"strong\">Traveler</span>: Here they are. <br><span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>: Your bags are heavy. There is a $100 overweight charge. <br><span class=\"strong\">Traveler</span> : $100!? <br> <span class=\"strong\">Ticket Agent</span>: Your carry-on is large as well. You need to check it too. That's $150 in total. <br><span class=\"strong\"> Traveler</span>: Oh my gosh!"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "passenger list"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a list of people booked to fly by an airline at a specific time"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: You are not on the passenger list."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud01"}]}, {"type": "target_word_describer", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": " Use these words when you check-in at the airport."}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "counter"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a desk in a bank, store or an airport"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Is this the counter for United Airlines?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud02"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "airline"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a business that carries passengers or goods by air"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: What airline did you travel with?"}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud03"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "porter "}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a person to carry your bags in an airport or train station."}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: This porter will help you with your bags, Ma'am."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud04"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "carry-on"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a small bag you can take onto the plane"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Put your carry-on under the seat, please."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud05"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "scale"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "a device for weighing"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Please place your luggage on the scale."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud06"}]}, {"type": "target_word", "contents": [{"type": "name", "content": "overweight charge"}, {"type": "definition", "content": "extra money for heavy bags"}, {"type": "part_speech", "content": "(noun)"}, {"type": "example", "content": "Example: Your bags are heavy. There might be an overweight charge."}, {"type": "audio", "content": "engenn3le09ob03aud07"}]}, {"type": "background_image", "content": "engenn3le09ob03re1img01.jpg"}, {"type": "takeaway_extension", "contents": [{"type": "text", "content": "Think of ways first class plane travel is different from economy?"}, {"type": "text", "content": "Ask your partner to do the same."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Look at the chart. Fill in each area."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Tell a partner your ideas."}, {"type": "text", "content": "Listen to your partner's ideas."}, {"type": "table", "content": "{\"rows\":7,\"columns\":3,\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"First Class\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Economy\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">seats</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">food</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">luggage</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">waiting area</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"strong\\\">cost of ticket</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class=\\\"stro